[1819.64445, "o", "                         _                     _ _ _   \r\n                        | |__   __ _ _ __   __| (_) |_ \r\n                        | '_ \\ / _` | '_ \\ / _` | | __|\r\n                        | |_) | (_| | | | | (_| | | |_ \r\n                        |_.__/ \\__,_|_| |_|\\__,_|_|\\__|\r\n                                                       \r\n\r\n                      This is an OverTheWire game server. \r\n            More information on http://www.overthewire.org/wargames\r\n\r\nbackend: gibson-0\r\n"]
